{"job_id":"F-044ce3ae03547d25d38e","family_id":"F-044ce3ae03547d25d38e","title":"나라문장 규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"72e6926e7231061363ddc0d7d37b2d99cc17e81414d228195d9f3db1d310ad2d","source_hash":"0cc20eebcdc21990d5adb98501038ebc665aa42261cda1fbfff41870523bb145","text":"国徽条例"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":117,"target_id":"b75eb860f20ff8becd3a43ac803cb4ae837ac53a7ea5b62f9c7c55b13916c9d3","source_hash":"35cf3915efef4c7cefbd756ea9abb8d469508209404718e95c617d0e3f27b2a6","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定在对外派发的官方文件、国家重要文件以及其他设施、材料等上使用的象征大韩民国国徽的必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":117,"end":202,"target_id":"99bc026664dbd217d1a24415849eff3a987a4fe3037da3648572f3917e17a23f","source_hash":"ab32f554193e30284f781553b8e8e94cdce18228cad2526d9bd5db38e7c50944","text":"第二条（标准）国徽应当按照附表规定制作，并可作为徽章或铁印使用。但其规格可以根据需要进行放大或缩小。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":202,"end":468,"target_id":"2e969530856a2632a9dd2beab1297b33874a70e289d7b1e3151e20d3b99ad153","source_hash":"4ddeccb0ffba895fed941b9219d369503301bb40f7ef1113f0024fc7212a7f5d","text":"第三条（使用）国徽可用于下列文件、设施或材料上。\n1. 发往外国、国际组织或国内对外机构的官方文件\n2. 一级或以上公职人员（包括高级公务员）委任书\n3. 奖章、奖章证书和总统嘉奖\n4. 国家公务员 ID\n5. 国立大学和公立大学的毕业证书和学位证书\n6. 海外外交使团大楼\n7. 政府所有的船舶和飞机\n8. 货币\n9. 各中央行政机关负责人认为有必要带有国徽的其他文件、设施或材料\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":468,"end":539,"target_id":"e5bac39c0a882535ba79388651e7ae0cd809d063d04b8d499cc19a1a943bfe6a","source_hash":"546f3a0f5b51c63b8e85da52fcc366c3266df892370d0131ef9987c53b17c78c","text":"第四条（国徽或印章的位置）在文件上使用国徽或印章时，应将其盖在文件的顶部中心位置。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":539,"end":582,"target_id":"624e04a535a7d2368d541a74cd67a15e3017e006a52d4815a7c6ecc70891b132","source_hash":"c34d1b77d159ddba80573d4e76a640fdad2e28009c2ba1b7187e83375220d36b","text":"补充规定 <第5151号，1970年7月3日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":582,"end":619,"target_id":"620ab2377375bd795224ff53895bfb8ce98ae70bd786923f7892ca6dbee17f85","source_hash":"73f247a6c3d9b50b5dc028e6cd54c4b438285c68aede5fb19915c06efce776db","text":"增补（高级公务员人事条例）<第19513号，2006年6月12日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":619,"end":655,"target_id":"33153ea24b5d188073121a739de02f903a7eb7ddf6813ccb7943c80bbfc1e39c","source_hash":"0e94a08c2a71f70cb6d96527e2a9581ff50930d0b9f006904c6179e63655524b","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2006年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":655,"end":669,"target_id":"0e7ad7001e11678d0f9fdb6de63aaee537d235a515d016e930a847d179c5bcf7","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":669,"end":814,"target_id":"c2e7002097ff0928b703465bb80b6d76725f07033525a5cda177d2bd1033d385","source_hash":"5a28db6f6c493f0d49689770ff4ed9c7f818723a7ea72d21d455241d6eed5e2c","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<68> 已省略\n\n  <69> 国徽条例修订如下。\n\n  第三条第二款修改如下。\n\n    2. 一级或以上公务员（包括高级公务员）委任书\n\n  <70> 至 <241> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"BODY","start":814,"end":939,"target_id":"c11ee0c7bd3929f85a126587cc6e3de82a12e68c8ead0ba3c3d3cf7e0d092121","source_hash":"020e29b8369e05644b3f1f940f86c370a4676fc93b8354dde9eda4456f680135","text":"补充规定 <第23399号，2011年12月28日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n国徽\n[附录] <修订于 2011.12.28>                        \n\n  注意：用作钢铁侠时请勿添加颜色。"},{"id":"A28667-zh-00001","doc":"A28667","law_id":"kr-003134-119766-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2041354","source_hash":"71e621c25